google-qr-sms-web

Portions of this project are adapted from google-qr-sms-helper
(https://github.com/havenicec/google-qr-sms-helper), Copyright (c)
havenicec, used under the MIT License.

Adapted material includes: the QR-code extraction logic, the
devicephoneverification batchexecute RPC sequence (MypxBd / YDtwf),
the [3,null,4] fallback check, the selection-page URL construction,
the iPad Mini / iPhone user-agent strings, and the navigator spoof
property set. The delivery mechanism (Chrome DevTools Protocol
instead of a browser extension) is original to this project.
